creatures:
- name: Cloaker
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 14  
      **Hit Points** 91 (rollable(dice=14d10 + 14,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 10 ft., Fly 40 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Initiative) (15)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=7)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Condition Immunities** frightened  
      **Senses** darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 12  
      **Languages** Deep Speech, Undercommon  
      **Challenge** 8 (3,900 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +3  

      ## Traits

      ***Light Sensitivity.*** While in ***Bright Light***, the cloaker has ***Disadvantage*** on attack rolls.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The cloaker makes one Attach attack and two Tail attacks.

      ***Attach.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Attach]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=3d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Attach]) Piercing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, the cloaker attaches to it. While the cloaker is attached, the target has the ***Blinded*** condition, and the cloaker can't make Attach attacks against other targets. In addition, the cloaker halves the damage it takes (round down), and the target takes the same amount of damage.

      The cloaker can detach itself by spending 5 feet of movement. The target or a creature within 5 feet of it can take an action to try to detach the cloaker, doing so by succeeding on a DC 14 Strength (***Athletics***) check.

      ***Tail.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Tail]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d10+3,dicelabel=Damage [Tail]) Slashing damage.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Moan.*** *Wisdom Saving Throw:* DC 13, each creature in a 60-foot ***Emanation*** originating from the cloaker. *Failure:* The target has the ***Frightened*** condition until the end of the cloaker's next turn. *Success:* The target is immune to this cloaker's Moan for the next 24 hours.

      ***Phantasms (Recharge after a Short or Long Rest).*** The cloaker casts the [Mirror Image](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619060-mirror-image) spell, requiring no spell components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability. The spell ends early if the cloaker starts or ends its turn in ***Bright Light***.

      At will: [Mirror Image](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619060-mirror-image)  

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Large Aberration, Chaotic Neutral*  
    **Challenge** 8
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024cloaker
  status: 1

